  "translation": "Gomme Dafida a re go bahlanka ba gagwe moka bao ba nago ⟨את⟩ le yena Yerushalayime: Tsohang, re balele, gobane go tla ba go se sepholohi go rena go sego pelo ga Abshalome; lekaneya go tšwa, gore a se ke a lekaneya gomme a re hwetša, a rola bokgodi go rena ⟨את⟩, gomme a betša motse ka molomo wa tšhoša.",
